        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>两个预配置：Knowledge Server ＋ CANoe MCP 服务器；兼容 CANoe 20 SP2。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
